[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3902.51, "timestamp": "01:05:02", "text": "一切都很轻盈。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3905.51, "timestamp": "01:05:05", "text": "一切。听着，我不能告诉你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3907.75, "timestamp": "01:05:07", "text": "我当时压力很大，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3910.47, "timestamp": "01:05:10", "text": "整个流程本身就像有很多事情要做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3911.99, "timestamp": "01:05:11", "text": "然后还有很多法律方面的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3914.15, "timestamp": "01:05:14", "text": "你必须这样做，就像你知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3916.23, "timestamp": "01:05:16", "text": "所有类似的过道和所有东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3918.87, "timestamp": "01:05:18", "text": "除此之外，还有去签证处办理签证之类的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3922.309, "timestamp": "01:05:22", "text": "诸如此类的事情，真是太让人焦虑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3924.63, "timestamp": "01:05:24", "text": "我记得当时我不得不搬家，这让我想起了以前的情景。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3926.71, "timestamp": "01:05:26", "text": "就像九月份的苏格兰一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3930.309, "timestamp": "01:05:30", "text": "2023年，整个六月我都在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3933.27, "timestamp": "01:05:33", "text": "做某事，比如去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3935.51, "timestamp": "01:05:35", "text": "在那里，就像每一天一样，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3938.63, "timestamp": "01:05:38", "text": "压力也很大，经常暴饮暴食。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3940.47, "timestamp": "01:05:40", "text": "因为这件事而感到非常焦虑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3942.39, "timestamp": "01:05:42", "text": "全新的地方。我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3945.109, "timestamp": "01:05:45", "text": "任何人。我不知道，就像你知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3946.87, "timestamp": "01:05:46", "text": "比如，什么是本地居民的现场活动？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3948.71, "timestamp": "01:05:48", "text": "他们会是什么样的人，或者他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3950.71, "timestamp": "01:05:50", "text": "接待处就像没人接待一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3953.349, "timestamp": "01:05:53", "text": "你一无所有。你必须从……开始"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3954.933, "timestamp": "01:05:54", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Yoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3957.27, "timestamp": "01:05:57", "text": "划痕。这很可怕，但又不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3959.19, "timestamp": "01:05:59", "text": "也是一次很棒的经历。"}]